(text "Two isolated normally-open contacts parallel the original case buttons.\nNo host LED sensing or isolated supply. Pin 9 remains this host reference for button ESD protection ONLY.\nDo not join host references to controller ground or to one another. Pins 5..8 and 10 are NC.\nUse verified motherboard signal names, not a universal F_PANEL physical pin map."(at 12 20 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left))(uuid aca7054b-73d7-5663-8f32-6256151c3e52))
